<title>UK: Daiwa leads 100 mln mark Turkey-linked bond. [CORRECTED 09:05 GMT]</title>
<headline>Daiwa leads 100 mln mark Turkey-linked bond. [CORRECTED 09:05 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Daiwa.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TURKISH SOVEREIGN REPACKAGED NOTES</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    26.JUN.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE  S-14.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.875     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD     +355 BP</p>
<p>(Corrects spread to +355 BP from +55 BP.)</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10    SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE/KY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BUND DUE JUNE 2003</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
